<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Sports Authority upped.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Sports Authority upped.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs said it upgraded Sports Authority Inc TSA.N, adding it to the recommended list from market outperform.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Sports Authority gained 1-3/8 to 19-3/8.</p>
</text>
